 "pdf": "ads1158.pdf",
 "pages": "p.4 (supplies), p.5-6 (pins), p.7 (SPI timing), p.17 (Table 3 data rates), p.23 (Table 7 codes), p.25-26 (conversion control), p.28-30 (SPI, commands), p.31-32 (channel data format), p.33-38 (command byte, Table 11 registers)",
 "notModeled": [
  "analog inputs, multiplexer, chopping, sensor bias, switch-time delay DLY (stored only)",
  "auto-scan channel sequencing: the channel pointer and STATUS.CHID are not advanced (CHID stays 0); the result is the 0 V code for every channel; the system readings (offset, VCC, TEMP, GAIN, REF) are not computed",
  "Channel Data Read Direct (DIN 000/111 for the first three bits) is the default out pattern [STATUS] R{16}; with fixed-channel mode or STAT=0 the datasheet drops the status byte (Table 12), the model always sends it; after a direct read the datasheet ignores commands until CS toggles",
  "STATUS.OVF and SUPPLY are never set",
  "conversion time is the steady data rate of Table 3 at fCLK = 16 MHz (chop off, delay 0); the initial start delay (Table 8), standby/sleep wake-up and IDLMOD are not modeled",
  "START pin linked to a GPIO via GPIOD writes; GPIO pins are not driven and GPIOD reads do not return pin levels",
  "SPI interface timeout (SPIRST, 256/4096 fCLK), CLKSEL / crystal oscillator / CLKIO clock output",
  "DRDY 1-tCLK high pulse when data are not read"
 ],
